// client-request-id's UUID masked; MSAL's x-client-* telemetry headers
// dropped: this port sends none) and its body. Each exported cache is
// its JSON with object keys sorted (Go writes its maps in no fixed
// order) and each Unix time as its offset from the run's start,
// rounded to 10 s.

